Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop 04 --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:11.22,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Well, doesn't your dad always come pick you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:14.90,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi isn't my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:17.03,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa is. {my dad}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.70,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,That's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:22.80,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has a mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.82,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,So, who's Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:29.92,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.29,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,But men can't have babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.38,Overlap,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you say a lot of weird things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:32.30,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.97,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Not everyone needs a dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:35.82,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:38.70,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Only idiots call others idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:40.01,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot, idiot, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.49,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Hiro-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:47.70,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun called me an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:50.02,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hiro-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:44.27,Overlap,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:54.99,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it just you and your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:58.96,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My dad left us and then they got a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:00.41,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's a "divorce"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.37,0:01:05.96,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's when you stop being married. {intentionally worded childish. they're kids after all}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:10.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if my mom's gone because she got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:13.44,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:16.00,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They'll scold you if you don't wear your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:19.14,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:23.30,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your string is loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.23,0:01:32.08,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, your dad's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:34.47,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:34.49,Overlap,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:37.84,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-tan's daddy is... {he's trying to pronounce words, but has trouble}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:43.62,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, Maa-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:56.87,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,See you soon, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:58.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:00.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:02.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:04.34,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:07.05,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:38.90,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:38.90,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:49.65,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:52.36,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,She's just an annoying old lady at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.55,0:03:56.20,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:59.65,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,She always seems to be taking care of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:01.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:06.55,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He's not very sociable, so he has a hard time making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.29,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:11.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! I should be saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:13.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's also really unsociable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:17.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess like attracts like, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:20.91,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! You were talking about me just now, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:22.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't anything bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:24.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Go on, keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:25.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me to carry you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:27.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:29.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:33.79,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Is Rin-chan your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:36.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no, I'm not her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.87,0:04:38.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm more like a relative...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:41.01,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry, I shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:42.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.93,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:52.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you made a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:52.93,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:57.81,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun said he doesn't have a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.85,0:05:01.27,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He said his dad left them and got a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:04.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You know what that means, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:07.99,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It's when you stop being married, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:10.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:15.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Won't they be punished by God if they're found out? {i worded this to avoid saying something like "If God finds out, won't *he* punish them", becuz i dont like identifying god xD}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:23.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if my mom's gone because she got a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:28.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to meet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:31.54,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:35.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:41.73,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:45.19,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If she's like Kouki-kun's mom, then I'd like to meet her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:47.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:55.08,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say about her mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:06:00.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I said her mother was probably Grandpa's maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.49,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:05.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever heard anything about his maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.02,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,That worked out pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:09.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A farewell party? For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:11.52,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry it's a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:13.81,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Orders for winter clothes just slowed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:14.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:17.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But I really can't go out at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.19,0:06:18.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have a six year old at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:22.56,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,You mean you haven't gone out for drinks even once this whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:25.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope. I can't go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:29.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I'm not really interested in going out for drinks anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:30.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'm getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.66,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,You're only thirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:35.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Also, a lot of the young people in my\Nshipping department have kids as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so they don't go out for drinks either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:38.28,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:40.33,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.07,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,I have to go to the daycare after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.96,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,We had two kids in two years, and the younger one's just three months old,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:46.83,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,so if I don't get home right away, my wife will...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:49.28,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Turn into a demon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:52.13,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,She's real scary when she gets angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:57.14,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:58.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.40,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I heard about your farewell party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:04.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I can't go out at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:07.53,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,But they've spent so much time preparing for it, so why not bring your kid along?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.83,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring mine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:12.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you saying you want to go out drinking sometimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:14.39,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:16.66,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming, coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:21.69,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:24.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:24.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:28.70,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, apparently Grandpa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.70,0:07:31.55,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,had the maid hired from an agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:33.12,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So, do you know her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:38.82,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshii Masako-san. She uses the\Ncharacters for "correct" and "child."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:42.18,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't that the name on the child care handbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:43.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:46.11,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to get in touch with her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:50.44,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How could she abandon such a cute girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.44,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you see the handbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:54.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's a ton of stuff written in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:56.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We still don't know the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:02.56,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:04.12,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.88,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,my work and home life are getting all jumbled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:07.88,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:11.91,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you're late! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.96,0:08:11.92,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stay there, you drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:16.21,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! You came?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.14,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.10,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:26.90,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Eat all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:28.49,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:30.26,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,It's good to see you here, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:32.23,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:35.49,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Rin-chan. Is orange juice alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:36.99,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:38.95,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan sure is pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:40.55,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,She really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:41.57,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,She's blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:42.86,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:49.72,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu-kun, I'll push it all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:52.00,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:56.37,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Kawachi-san! Drink some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:08:58.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin might fall asleep on our way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:08:59.60,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:02.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'm just going to the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.03,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Say "bathroom"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:06.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, fine. I'm going to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:11.30,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,He just got up and left our section.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:14.75,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,He basically produced results only for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.14,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,That's dirty of him to quit while ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:18.74,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Our sales are in a slump this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:22.29,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we sell a decent amount,\Nupper management will only see last year's records.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:23.78,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,What'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.78,0:09:26.12,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, we're in a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:28.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I was still my old self,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I would have without a doubt gone in there and chewed them out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:33.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Crap, I didn't pee.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.63,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:38.49,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to be my kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:43.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I guess I've figured out what's truly important to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:45.56,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.31,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,About you transferring...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:53.94,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,After seeing Rin-chan tonight,\NI've come to understand your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:57.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:10:00.20,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, Mama! Pick me up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:00.20,Overlap,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hold her forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:03.06,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san, I think Rin wants to be put down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Masako-san.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:10.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What do you think of your daughter?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:14.43,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't Yuu-kun really cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:17.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You love little kids, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.31,0:10:17.93,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:19.16,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:20.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:25.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's an information session for\Nadmissions into elementary school!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:29.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even ask for this! {i didn't even do anything and it came}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:30.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:35.19,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a test to get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:36.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:39.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You can get in without taking a test!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.11,0:10:39.93,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:44.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mandatory education really is something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:49.91,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:52.90,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Darn! How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:58.49,MainLow,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, he's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.88,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:04.50,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone already left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.13,0:11:06.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.98,0:11:09.86,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, your mother's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.65,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:15.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:17.55,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.37,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, are we going to make it on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:23.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get a cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.56,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:30.62,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Since the children's name tags can be flipped around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:34.80,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,their names should remain unseen on their way to and from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:38.64,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Also, your children should not go alone to places like the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:41.21,Main,Man,0000,0000,0000,,And even if they know someone, they should never go with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:43.72,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's sad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:48.45,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,They're emphasizing suspicion over trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:53.35,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Where's that document we just got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:55.19,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hold them! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:59.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How do we find out what\Nimmunizations they've gotten so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:07.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, looks like I just asked a really stupid question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:08.48,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:11.08,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have Rin-chan's child care handbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:15.58,Handbook,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\move(794,178,817,158,0,4488)}Maternity and Child\NCare Handbook
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:15.58,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\move(711,594,715,614,0,4488)}Kaga Souichi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:15.58,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\move(699,622,701,643,0,4488)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:15.58,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\move(664,657,666,683,0,4488)}Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:15.58,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It has a page for immunizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:17.29,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Then you'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.45,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:24.47,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:27.73,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I met Rin for the first time three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:30.27,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Three months, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:32.44,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:34.31,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:38.58,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I get the feeling that Rin-chan really trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:41.23,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.23,0:12:45.70,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,At home, she talks back a lot and harps on everything I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.03,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That just means she trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:52.57,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Any way you look at it, you two are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:54.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Family?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.50,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:03.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:12.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.38,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I jumped over your shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:22.64,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:23.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.97,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:31.70,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:36.26,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's almost got everything she needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:42.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A knapsack? No, I haven't gotten one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:43.47,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Then get on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:46.97,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,All of the brand label and\Nfashionable ones are already sold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:48.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll just get a regular one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:51.10,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's no good for a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, I'll look this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.06,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, are you really going to continue raising Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:02.40,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, you transferred sections, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:05.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't really given it much thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:06.49,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:09.49,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do your hair now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:10.49,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:14.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You two really get along, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:19.04,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, a mother and her daughter are like friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:29.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Now that I think about it,\NMom and Kazumi are close too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:35.17,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Maybe Masako-san will change her mind and want to live with her daughter.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:42.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Wow, she got a ton of immunizations.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Her mother must have pushed for them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.11,Will,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.5\pos(308,356)}Souichi's Will
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.11,Ro,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(569,345)}Right on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.11,0:14:51.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A will?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:53.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Right on"?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:57.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"If Masako found this, she would probably dispose of it,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:15:01.58,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"which is why I have chosen this discreet method."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:05.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"However, I don't know how to correctly write an official will,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:09.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"and this keyboard is making a fool out of me,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.55,0:15:12.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"so I have no choice but to continue very slowly."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He doesn't know how to properly convert the characters!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"By now, this old fool's drained of energy,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:20.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"which is why I'm giving up writing this blog."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:24.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He gave up that quickly?! So much for being old and wise!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:27.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"The rest is in Rin's child care handbook."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:35.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm sorry Rin, but I'm going to take a peek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:47.00,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Assuming that whoever comes across this\Npiece of paper has Rin's best interests in mind,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:51.92,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I write this concerning Rin and her mother, Masako.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:01.68,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}First, I'd like to say that though\NMasako is easily misunderstood,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:05.48,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}she is by no means a bad person.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:11.44,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She says she is a failure of a mother, and that she feels sorry for Rin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.44,0:16:17.97,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She still insists on remaining here as my maid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:20.77,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And she will most likely continue to do so.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:24.76,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I believe that is Rin's most treasured happiness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:27.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Happiness? What's he talking about?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:30.57,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even if something were to happen to me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:34.67,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}none of my relatives would find anything about her{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.67,0:16:39.09,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}because she has been extremely careful in removing any trace of her existence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:43.05,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Masako certainly has a motherly love for Rin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:51.69,Main,Gpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}However, as she is still young, perhaps she does not have the maturity required of a parent.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:55.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I don't really understand it all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:17:02.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But the one thing that's clear is that he held Rin and her mother very closely.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.92,YM,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.6\fad(0,300)\pos(703,341)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.26,Cell,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.8\pos(634,394)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:14.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:17.62,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:23.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can you do my hair up like a rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:23.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:27.85,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Remember? Like Reina-chan's mom did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:28.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:29.73,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Absolutely no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:36.55,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do it, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:40.79,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She said I wasn't cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:44.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:48.49,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mii-chan said I wasn't cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:54.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rin definitely wins in my eyes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:57.18,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want to look cute too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:18:00.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:10.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Since she's already so mature, she feels hurt even more.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:16.65,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Do you know how much Rin has grown, Masako-san?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:20.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Still, she has some more growing up to do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:22.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Which is why she needs an adult around, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:28.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:33.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This doesn't...{\i0} {probably implying it doesn't look right}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:45.06,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Twinkle, twinkle, little star...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.83,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,How I wonder... {cuts before the 'what you are'}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.81,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, Rin? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:51.30,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let you see stuff for our Festival Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:53.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Festival Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:55.86,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No peeking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:59.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She's going to perform it with that hairdo?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:07.95,Cell2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.8\pos(633,404)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:15.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you left thinking Rin would eventually forget about the pain of your absence,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:19.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}then I have no problems with hating you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:23.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You'd better have a good reason.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:25.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Still...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:32.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What reason could you have for leaving your child?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:35.82,Desk,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(614,376)}Study Desk
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:35.82,Chair,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(695,532)}Study Chair
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:35.82,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:41.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure it's cute, but if you're going to use one for a long time, you want a more...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:43.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:45.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How about a desk fit for young ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:48.79,Chair2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.6\pos(265,225)}Study Chair
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:47.56,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Young ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:52.21,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I want one fit for young ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:53.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Alright!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:56.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're still sitting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.37,0:19:58.42,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I look like a young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:03.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. And I think this desk will do even when you're in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:04.58,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will I be an adult then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:08.20,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You'd be half of an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:13.98,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me read.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:20.19,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"A young girl went into the forest to play."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.19,0:20:26.09,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"She got lost, and no matter how hard she tried to find her way back home,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:29.40,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"she couldn't."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:34.58,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"Suddenly, she saw a little house in the middle of the forest."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:51.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, is this Yoshii-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:53.94,Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.39,0:22:28.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't this one cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.53,0:22:29.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:30.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.38,0:22:32.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.03,0:22:33.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.87,0:22:37.41,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:40.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you not to leave my side like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.17,0:22:41.67,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.67,0:22:44.17,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.17,0:22:46.08,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It makes me a young lady! {it's lipstick btw}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:51.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope! Not until later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.88,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:22:56.94,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
